    "title": "反而 + unexpected alternative",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-stance-p15-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "反而 + unexpected alternative",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "反而 introduces an outcome opposite to the expected direction. It is not simply any contrast between two unrelated facts.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他没有生气，反而笑了。",
                "pinyin": "tā méiyǒu shēngqì ， fǎn'ér xiào le 。",
                "meaning": "He did not get angry; instead, he laughed.",
                "audio": "6ace874b62edc81a9f39acae57252f8280078616045789e906b25d46f8ddbd25"
              },
              {
                "text": "雨没停，反而更大了。",
                "pinyin": "yǔ méi tíng ， fǎn'ér gèng dà le 。",
                "meaning": "The rain did not stop; instead, it grew heavier.",
                "audio": "53d56b20140f4d06d6c70f8ab44e43512eef8f99160b607a4a547f917bc792b5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "反而",
                "pinyin": "fǎn'ér",
                "meaning": "on the contrary; instead",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "40f79a507da473d7d2ca8538de46c9df3eaeab4a9f1773d5f5081e1504b53889"
              }
            ]
